1
00:04:38,181 --> 00:04:44,181
Henry & Henrietta… the love couple of the
seventies... and the laugh riot of the year.

2
00:09:16,363 --> 00:09:22,363
A New Leaf is a comedy, romance film directed by Elaine May.

3
00:13:54,545 --> 00:14:00,545
After running out of funds, Henry Graham, a carefree playboy, plots to
marry and murder wealthy botanist Henrietta Lowell.

4
00:18:32,727 --> 00:18:38,727
Henry Graham, played by Walter Matthau.

5
00:23:10,909 --> 00:23:16,909
Henrietta Lowell, played by Elaine May.

6
00:27:49,090 --> 00:27:55,090
Andy McPherson, played by Jack Weston.

7
00:32:27,272 --> 00:32:33,272
Harold, played by George Rose.

8
00:37:05,454 --> 00:37:11,454
Uncle Harry, played by James Coco.

9
00:41:43,636 --> 00:41:49,636
Mrs. Traggert, played by Doris Roberts.

10
00:46:21,818 --> 00:46:27,818
A New Leaf is a 1971 American black comedy film written and directed by Elaine May in her
directorial debut, based on the short story "The Green Heart" by Jack Ritchie.

11
00:51:00,000 --> 00:51:06,000
It stars May, Walter Matthau, Jack Weston, George Rose and James Coco.

12
00:55:38,181 --> 00:55:44,181
In the film, patrician New York City playboy Henry Graham has run out of money.

13
01:00:16,363 --> 01:00:22,363
He decides to find a wealthy bride, and finds shy heiress Henrietta Lowell.

14
01:04:54,545 --> 01:05:00,545
He takes control of her finances after their
wedding, and fires her dishonest staff.

15
01:09:32,727 --> 01:09:38,727
He carefully plans to poison her, but even his own best laid plans go awry.

16
01:14:10,909 --> 01:14:16,909
The film was a critical success on its initial release.

17
01:18:49,090 --> 01:18:55,090
However, despite several accolades, award nominations, and a run at Radio
City Music Hall, A New Leaf fared poorly at the box office.

18
01:23:27,272 --> 01:23:33,272
However, it is now considered a cult classic.

19
01:28:05,454 --> 01:28:11,454
In 2019, the film was selected by the Library of Congress for preservation in the United States
National Film Registry for being "culturally, historically, or aesthetically significant".

20
01:32:43,636 --> 01:32:49,636
The film explores themes of bankrupt, camping, dark comedy, botanist, murder.

21
01:37:21,818 --> 01:37:27,818
The tone is lighthearted and dark and emotional.
